====== Linksys E2000 v1 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The Linksys E2000 is based on the same hardware as the [[wrt320n_v1|Linksys WRT320N v2.0]] with changes to the CFE and a larger NVRAM block.  The E2000 is based on the Broadcom 4717 cpu running at 354MHz.  It has 8 MB flash and 32 MB SDRAM. The WNICs are provided by the BCM4717 SoC (2.4GHz B, G and N) and a second constituent chip, the BCM4322 (5GHz A and N). The switch is a BCM53115 chip. The E2000 runs 802.11 A, B, G, and Draft N wireless protocols. It provides 4 gigabit LAN ports and 1 WAN port.

